  {
    "id": "1960917703474209171",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "访谈还讨论了“Jevons Paradox”（杰文斯悖论）在软件领域的体现：即使 AI 极大提升了生产力，社会对软件和代码的需求仍在不断增长，许多产品和服务依然有待优化。",
    "created_at": "2025-08-28T04:09:47.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1960917701037318613",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "他预测，未来软件工程师的工作重心将从代码实现转向高层决策与架构设计。两到四年后，工程师可能不再直接编写代码，而是通过自然语言或更高级的界面指挥 AI 完成具体实现。Scott 认为，这不会减少软件工程师的数量，反而会因门槛降低而增加需求。",
    "created_at": "2025-08-28T04:09:46.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1960917697488937005",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "Scott 详细阐述了“本质复杂性”（essential complexity）与“偶然复杂性”（accidental complexity）的区别。前者指软件工程师需要做出的核心决策与逻辑设计，后者则是为支持系统扩展而必须完成的重复性工作。AI 工具的出现，使得工程师可以将更多精力投入到本质复杂性，减少机械性劳动。 https://t.co/WuEuzPJB8s https://t.co/lwAvUuc3a9",
    "created_at": "2025-08-28T04:09:45.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
